        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.183,
            0.815,
            0.209
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Let us check our solution : "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "AP =\\sqrt{\\left(6-0\\right)^{2}+\\left(5-9\\right)^{2}}=\\sqrt{36+16}=\\sqrt{52}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.362,
            0.226,
            0.828,
            0.253
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_6_equation_4.jpg",
          "content": "\\mathrm{BP} = \\sqrt{ \\left( - 4 - 0 \\right) ^ { 2 } + \\left( 3 - 9 \\right) ^ { 2 } } = \\sqrt{16 + 36} = \\sqrt{52}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.095,
            0.262,
            0.901,
            0.302
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Note :",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Using the remark above, we see that (0, 9) is the intersection of the y-axis and the perpendicular bisector of AB."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
